This software depends on third-party crates retrieved via Cargo, each under its
own license. Notably, the tool layer is built on components of the oh-my-pi
project (https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi):

  - pi-ast   — structural (tree-sitter / ast-grep) code search and rewrite
  - pi-shell — in-process bash execution with output minimization
  - pi-iso   — copy-on-write workspace isolation and diff capture

LLM provider adapters are built on rig (https://github.com/0xPlaygrounds/rig).

Refer to each dependency's repository and license for its terms.
